catflow 0.8
1. Read Files            invoices/; pattern=*.pdf
2. <each read_one; on_error=skip>   [file] -> [text]
     1. Read PDF             (input:1)
     2. Extract Structured               Qwen3 8B; "vendor, date, total,
                                         currency"
     3. Table to Text                    format=csv
3. Join Text             separator="\n"
4. Text to Table         expected="vendor, date, total, currency"
5. Chart                 kind=bar; x=vendor; y=total
6. Save Image            spend-by-vendor.png
7. Table to Text   (4)   format=markdown
8. Save Text             ledger.md
